# /etc/whispera/whispera.env (0640 root:whispera). No secrets in this file:
# the APNs key lives in /etc/whispera/apns.p8 (0600 whispera), written by inject-secrets.sh.
WHISPERA_LISTEN=127.0.0.1:8080
WHISPERA_DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///var/lib/whispera/whispera.db
WHISPERA_TRUST_PROXY_HEADERS=true
# Clerk production instance (whispera.mansurov.dev). Native apps use the
# "whispera" JWT template ({"aud":"whispera"}), so bind on aud, not azp.
WHISPERA_OIDC_ISSUER=https://clerk.whispera.mansurov.dev
WHISPERA_OIDC_AUDIENCES=whispera
APNS_AUTH_KEY_P8_FILE=/etc/whispera/apns.p8
APNS_KEY_ID=__APNS_KEY_ID__
APNS_TEAM_ID=__APNS_TEAM_ID__
APNS_TOPIC=com.chatgenie.Whispera
RUST_LOG=info
